@startuml
!include common.iuml
title Ceylon Eats — State Machine: Posting Status
skinparam state {
  BackgroundColor #F4F8FF
  BorderColor #2F5597
}
[*] --> Pending : user submits
Pending --> Approved : independent moderator approves
Pending --> Rejected : moderator rejects (reason)
Approved --> Rejected : moderator unpublishes
Rejected --> Approved : independent moderator re-approves
Approved : visible publicly\ncounts toward ratings
Rejected : hidden; reason shown to author\nauthor may rewrite review
Pending : hidden from public
@enduml
